#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Add the four missing Quebec service regions (NETWORK DATA configuration only —
no booking/code changes): QC-MAURICIE, QC-LANAUDIERE, QC-LAURENTIDES,
QC-OUTAOUAIS.

Polygons: Statistics Canada 2021 Census Division boundaries from the same
Esri Canada FeatureServer used for regions 142-159, simplified, then CLIPPED
against every existing approved polygon (existing approved boundaries are
never modified; the new regions yield to them).

FSAs: StatsCan 2021 FSA boundary file; an FSA is moved only when its majority
area (>=25%) falls inside the new region polygon. Every move is logged with
its previous owner; records owned by an approved official region are never
touched.

Idempotent: create-or-update by region code.
Run: odoo-bin shell -c /etc/odoo18.conf -d Prod-db --no-http < this_file
"""
